@startuml sd-high-availability
title AISafe - Fault Tolerance (gateway, Keycloak and replicas)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
autonumber

actor "Client" as C
participant "gateway-1\n:8443" as G1
participant "gateway-2\n:8444" as G2
participant "keycloak-1" as K1
participant "keycloak-2" as K2
participant "aircraft-1" as A1
participant "aircraft-2" as A2

== 1. Gateway failure ==
C -> G1 : request
G1 -[#red]-> C : no response
note over C : client tries the second URL
C -> G2 : request
G2 -> A1 : proxy
A1 --> G2 : 200
G2 --> C : 200

== 2. Keycloak node failure ==
C -> G2 : POST /realms/... (login)
G2 -> K1 : proxy
K1 -[#red]-> G2 : connection refused
note over G2 : proxy_next_upstream: tries the next node
G2 -> K2 : proxy
K2 --> G2 : token (same issuer, sessions in distributed cache)
G2 --> C : 200 access_token

== 3. Service replica failure ==
C -> G2 : GET /api/aircraft/CS-TTA
G2 -> A1 : proxy
A1 -[#red]-> G2 : connection refused (replica down)
note over G2 : replica is out for 10 s (max_fails=1)
G2 -> A2 : proxy (next attempt)
A2 --> G2 : 200
G2 --> C : 200

== 4. All replicas of a service down ==
C -> G2 : GET /api/aircraft/CS-TTA
G2 -[#red]-> C : 503 {"title":"Service Unavailable"}\n(other services continue to respond)
@enduml